  "description": "Single Storey front, side and rear extension following demolition of existing side garage; first floor side and rear extension and relocation of main entrance",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development is located within &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;surface water flood zone 3a (medium) and 3b\r\n(high). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;In the\r\nabsence of a satisfactory Flood Risk Assessment, it has not been demonstrated\r\nthat the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within\r\nthe site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary\r\nto National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy SI 12 of The London Plan\r\n(2021), Core Policy CS1.U of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policies DM9\r\nand DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
